.TH PATINA-PANEL 1 "2026-10-18" "patina-desktop 0.1.0" "Patina Desktop"
.SH NAME
patina-panel \- top panel of the Patina desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B patina-panel
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B patina-panel
draws the 36 pixel panel along the top edge of the screen as a layer-shell client of the
compositor: launcher button, workspace buttons, the title of the active app, a clock, and
status icons.
It is normally started by
.BR patina-session (1).
.SH BUGS
This is a pre-release. The panel shows placeholder data: the clock, battery level, active
title and notification badge are fixed sample values, and the launcher button and status
icons do not do anything yet.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B WGPU_BACKEND
Graphics API. Use
.B gl
in virtual machines and on machines without a Vulkan driver.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR patina-session (1),
.BR patina-compositor (1)
